            "notes": "[Pocket Bomb](item_83888c64-5648-4355-b546-674dde6b915c) triggers [Charged Plating](item_b8ca58e7-6ae2-40ee-8618-fe2f32315295) from before the spawn doors open, allowing you to maximize Rd 1's low cash threshold. \nIn the later rounds, this psuedo ultimate baits out crucial cooldowns, Moira\u2019s Fade, Suzu, Wraith, Orisa\u2019s Gold, etc... creating the opening for the real Pulse Bomb.\n \nCharged plating bypasses tracer's health passive nerf, giving her the full 25 armor instead of 19 with Armored Vest. This item is always a must pick whenever the cash after a round is awkward. Max value for $1k.\n\n\n[Armored Vest](item_358361e2-59be-4c81-b221-8a87f37809e6) nets you an extra 19 armour.\n\n[Plasma Converter](item_25869f9a-9a29-4e19-96b6-9d8a28c59318) seeks to bring you back to your armour with lifesteal.",
