            "created_at": "2025-09-24T21:51:47.528014+00:00",
            "notes": "[Phantasmic Flux](item_5e644a79-cf6e-4196-8d0a-232f75004643) is always a strong Round 2 pickup, but for Tracer it\u2019s especially powerful...granting up to 100 overhealth that completely ignores her health passive debuff.\n\n[Biolight Overflow](item_1220eaec-f913-4de2-816c-0dc070b285d0) works with your recall, granting the full 75 over health to yourself and your team. It comes in clutch with the tracer 1v1's or to keep up supports who are low. Similar to Junker Queens shout.\n\nOptional\n_________\n\n[Ironclad Exhaust Ports](item_2d085fa5-ace6-4fab-9323-b7a06268bcd0) is a great alternative to Biolight Overflow particularly if you dont intend to stay close to the team. It only grants 25 overhealth but works with blinks. The 5% cooldown can be handy.\n\n[Charged Plating](item_b8ca58e7-6ae2-40ee-8618-fe2f32315295) was already explained but is the best item if you have not generated enough cash from the previous round.",
