            "created_at": "2025-09-24T21:51:47.528014+00:00",
            "notes": "[Divine Intervention](item_b5148b7f-8529-4b1b-a90c-5d7cf13f8f0c) is probably the best survival item currently. Unlike what the description says it does not actually require the damage to be \"at once\". Instead the game keeps track of how much damage you take and once that number goes over 150 you get 30 overhealth. \n\nDamage to the overhealth gained gets counted towards Divine Interventions healthpool.\n\n\n---\nMore Weapon Power can be pivoted into instead with [Codebreaker](item_caa96c7e-655f-4d03-9bd9-0f41937fec27) if the enemy starts stacking armor.",
