            "created_at": "2025-09-24T21:51:47.528014+00:00",
            "notes": "[Auto Recall](item_ae3dbebf-c306-4408-b698-6f666ace0a7c) is the 5th round power of choice. Now you can become really aggressive with this get out of jail free card. \nYou get pulled out of shatters, gravs and even steel traps.\nUsing your ult reduces Recalls cooldown which = more overhealth.\n\n[Hardlight Accelerator](item_0390c8af-2a68-4da2-b876-93da32c3f448) is included not just for extra power, but to encourage a more aggressive playstyle. Triple-blinking into the enemy\u2019s face and unloading a full clip maximizes the bonus 15% weapon power over 3s. The plan then is to Recall out, then finish with a psuedo Pulse Bomb to trigger overshields and recover health lost in the interaction. The 10% cooldown reduction keeps Recall ready, making this cycle repeatable.",
